  "goodToKnow": "Die Sklaverei is slavery: die Abschaffung der Sklaverei (abolition), moderne Sklaverei (forced labour, trafficking). Der Sklave is a slave, a weak noun (den Sklaven), and versklaven means to enslave. Germany had colonies in Africa from 1884 to 1919, and the genocide of the Herero and Nama in present-day Namibia was officially acknowledged by Germany in 2021. Like all -ei nouns, it's feminine and stressed on -ei. It has no plural."
